{
  "sourcePatchId": "stereo-moog-filter-v1",
  "name": "Stereo Moog Filter",
  "description": "Stereo resonant low-pass filter using moogvcf. CC20 scales Cutoff and CC21 scales Resonance by CC/127, synchronously for both channels. MIDI channel defaults to 16. Starting the instrument initializes both shared CCs to maximum; use Reset Value 127 in controller sequencers. Channel 16/CC20-21 overlap Granular Capture defaults. Fully processed output; resonance near 1 can self-oscillate. Restart the rack after changing performance controllers.",
